    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><i>Mega Mouse</i></strong> is a <u><strong>3rd Person Action/Adventure</strong></u>\u00a0game,\u00a0set in a haunting dreamscape dimension occupied by the <i><strong>Shadow Cats</strong></i>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Jack was an ordinary mouse, haunted by his nightmares - until one night, Jack became aware he was dreaming and transformed into MEGA MOUSE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/9ec7643fc3dea415afaed67c658ff0ed.poster.avif?t=1748061410\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/9ec7643fc3dea415afaed67c658ff0ed.webm?t=1748061410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/9ec7643fc3dea415afaed67c658ff0ed.mp4?t=1748061410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the wonders of the <i>Shadow Realm - a world between worlds -\u00a0</i>and it's many unique challenges.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>Laser Rifle</i> &amp; <i>Rocket Launcher</i> to fight the Shadow Cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large variety of traps, puzzles and abstract challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fly and cruise through the Shadow Realm, as Mega Mouse takes on variety of forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, arcade like gameplay with intuitive control and non-stop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOAL:</strong> To break free from the control of the <i>Shadow Cats</i> and escape the <i>Shadow Realm</i>.<br><br><br>In a world between worlds, there are entities known as <strong>&quot;Shadow Cats&quot;</strong>.   <br>Take control of <strong>Mega Mouse</strong>\u00a0in this 3rd person action shooter, as you seek to escape their labyrinths - learning along the journey that reality is not exactly what it appears to be.</p></li></ul>",
